    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Under a Desert Sun: Seekers of the Cursed Vessel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273880/extras/3ededd9bc04811521ba021ae23845309.avif?t=1755503619\" data-has-big width=800 height=297 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture beneath the burning sands. Face an ancient evil. Survive... or be consumed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under a Desert Sun: Seekers of the Cursed Vessel is a single-player and co-op action RPG set against the backdrop of World War II and the supernatural legends of ancient Egypt. Play solo or team up with friends in local co-op (up to 4 players), with full online multiplayer planned during Early Access. Battle through intense combat, deadly traps, and supernatural hordes as you unravel a dark tale of ancient curses, lost treasures, and personal redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes Rise. Darkness Falls.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273880/extras/28f5a9ec546d1a0a11dbd10de2f11c5d.poster.avif?t=1755503619\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273880/extras/28f5a9ec546d1a0a11dbd10de2f11c5d.webm?t=1755503619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273880/extras/28f5a9ec546d1a0a11dbd10de2f11c5d.mp4?t=1755503619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up arms as one of two available heroes, with more on the way as Early Access evolves:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Soldier \u2013 A gruff American WWII veteran, skilled in firearms and explosives. His loyalty to his fallen comrades drives him into a fight far beyond the battlefield he knows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Adventurer \u2013 A tough-as-nails treasure hunter with Nigerian roots. Sharp with a pistol and sharper with her wit, she\u2019s in it for the gold\u2014but destiny has other plans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero features two unique skill systems at launch:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deck-based skill card system for build variety and synergy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A class-specific special weapon skill tree with powerful upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More heroes are in active development during Early Access\u2014including melee, hybrid, and stealth-oriented styles\u2014each expanding the story and deepening the fight against the Heretic King.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Single Player &amp; (Online)Co-op Action RPG</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in local co-op with up to 4 players. Online multiplayer will be added in future updates during Early Access.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Distinct Combat Styles</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Soldier\u2019s long-range firepower, grenades, and defensive shields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the Adventurer\u2019s dual pistols, melee combos, and mystical ethereal bow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future heroes will bring unique melee, ranged, and hybrid gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Atmospheric Exploration</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ancient tombs, open deserts, and war-ravaged ruins\u2014all handcrafted and filled with secrets, traps, and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Supernatural Meets Real-World Conflict</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face both Nazi invaders and undead horrors unleashed by a stolen artifact. Fight through a unique setting where historical warfare collides with mythological dread.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Rich, Cinematic Narrative</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a four-act story packed with personal character arcs, high-stakes missions, and the mystery of the cursed vessel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act 1 is fully playable in Early Access, with some voice acting already implemented and full VO coming in the final release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access Roadmap Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 playable classes at launch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act 1 fully playable in an open world with story-driven dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill card and weapon upgrade systems available from the start</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized loot, inventory, online multiplayer, and additional acts coming in future phases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 total acts and 6 planned heroes by final release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback will directly shape development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Artifact Is Stolen. The Heretic King Awakens. The World Trembles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends spoke of an artifact that binds the soul of an ancient tyrant. But now, stolen by ruthless forces, the seal is broken\u2014and the Heretic King stirs. His undead legions spread across the sands, consuming all in their path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you and your allies stand in the way of oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the curse... or be lost beneath the desert sun?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and join the adventure as the sands of time run out.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Under a Desert Sun: Seekers of the Cursed Vessel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273880/extras/3ededd9bc04811521ba021ae23845309.avif?t=1755503619\" data-has-big width=800 height=297 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture beneath the burning sands. Face an ancient evil. Survive... or be consumed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under a Desert Sun: Seekers of the Cursed Vessel is a single-player and co-op action RPG set against the backdrop of World War II and the supernatural legends of ancient Egypt. Play solo or team up with friends in local co-op (up to 4 players), with full online multiplayer planned during Early Access. Battle through intense combat, deadly traps, and supernatural hordes as you unravel a dark tale of ancient curses, lost treasures, and personal redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes Rise. Darkness Falls.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273880/extras/28f5a9ec546d1a0a11dbd10de2f11c5d.poster.avif?t=1755503619\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273880/extras/28f5a9ec546d1a0a11dbd10de2f11c5d.webm?t=1755503619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273880/extras/28f5a9ec546d1a0a11dbd10de2f11c5d.mp4?t=1755503619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up arms as one of two available heroes, with more on the way as Early Access evolves:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Soldier \u2013 A gruff American WWII veteran, skilled in firearms and explosives. His loyalty to his fallen comrades drives him into a fight far beyond the battlefield he knows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Adventurer \u2013 A tough-as-nails treasure hunter with Nigerian roots. Sharp with a pistol and sharper with her wit, she\u2019s in it for the gold\u2014but destiny has other plans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero features two unique skill systems at launch:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deck-based skill card system for build variety and synergy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A class-specific special weapon skill tree with powerful upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More heroes are in active development during Early Access\u2014including melee, hybrid, and stealth-oriented styles\u2014each expanding the story and deepening the fight against the Heretic King.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Single Player &amp; (Online)Co-op Action RPG</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in local co-op with up to 4 players. Online multiplayer will be added in future updates during Early Access.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Distinct Combat Styles</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Soldier\u2019s long-range firepower, grenades, and defensive shields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the Adventurer\u2019s dual pistols, melee combos, and mystical ethereal bow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future heroes will bring unique melee, ranged, and hybrid gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Atmospheric Exploration</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ancient tombs, open deserts, and war-ravaged ruins\u2014all handcrafted and filled with secrets, traps, and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Supernatural Meets Real-World Conflict</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face both Nazi invaders and undead horrors unleashed by a stolen artifact. Fight through a unique setting where historical warfare collides with mythological dread.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Rich, Cinematic Narrative</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a four-act story packed with personal character arcs, high-stakes missions, and the mystery of the cursed vessel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act 1 is fully playable in Early Access, with some voice acting already implemented and full VO coming in the final release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access Roadmap Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 playable classes at launch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Act 1 fully playable in an open world with story-driven dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill card and weapon upgrade systems available from the start</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized loot, inventory, online multiplayer, and additional acts coming in future phases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 total acts and 6 planned heroes by final release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback will directly shape development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Artifact Is Stolen. The Heretic King Awakens. The World Trembles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends spoke of an artifact that binds the soul of an ancient tyrant. But now, stolen by ruthless forces, the seal is broken\u2014and the Heretic King stirs. His undead legions spread across the sands, consuming all in their path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you and your allies stand in the way of oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the curse... or be lost beneath the desert sun?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and join the adventure as the sands of time run out.</p>",
    "short_description": "Under a Desert Sun: Seekers of the Cursed Vessel, is a single-player and co-op action RPG set in WWII-era Egypt. Battle soldiers and undead hordes, explore ancient tombs, and uncover a dark curse. Play solo or with friends in local co-op, with new heroes and content coming in Early Access.",
